{"id":147,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"校訓「恥を知れ」を根幹に据える人間教育","feature_description":"校訓「恥を知れ」を人間教育の根幹とし、時代の要請に応える教育を実践しています。この言葉を他人に向けるものではなく、自分自身を戒める教えとして説明し、自律心を育成。自律の土台に相手への尊敬や思いやり、礼儀を置き、日々受ける恩恵への感謝も大切にします。中高6年間の学びやクラブ活動を通じて、自らの適性や関心を生かし、現代の課題に向き合い社会に貢献する女性を目指します。","clubs":[{"id":2206,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2207,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2208,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2209,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2210,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2212,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2213,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2214,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2215,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/athletic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14922,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/academic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14923,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/academic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14924,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/academic","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14925,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otsuma.ed.jp/schoollife/academic","ver